# IslandGlyph: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_IslandGlyph.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
ipc island demo battery
wait 1
shot battery
note a red ring/disc (colour named "danger" read); Material: the icon on-error
ipc island dismissNewest
ipc recorder screen
wait 2
ipc recorder stop
wait 2
shot recording-saved
note the "Recording saved" alert's glyph is red, not the accent

look glass
ipc island demo battery
wait 1
shot battery
note a red ring/disc (colour named "danger" read); Material: the icon on-error
ipc island dismissNewest
ipc recorder screen
wait 2
ipc recorder stop
wait 2
shot recording-saved
note the "Recording saved" alert's glyph is red, not the accent
